{"text": "The barber looked startled, but Bernice calmly took the chair, and minutes later her long, beautiful hair lay on the floor around her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she looked into the mirror, she saw not a daring beauty but a plain, pale girl whose bare neck made her look strangely helpless. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Warrens face grew cold at once, and on the way home he spoke only politely to her, as though the spell had been broken forever. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her aunt was horrified as well, and looking at Marjories satisfied smile, Bernice finally understood that her cousin had planned the whole humiliation. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night, after packing her bag for a late train, Bernice crept into Marjories room, where her cousin lay sleeping with two long golden braids. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a pair of shears in her hand, she carefully cut off both braids, and Marjorie, sleeping soundly, did not wake up at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she slipped out of the house carrying her bag and the braids, and on her way to the station she passed Warrens house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Laughing wildly, she flung the golden braids onto his porch and ran on toward the station, leaving the town and her cousin behind.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "r", "b", "e", "r", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "t", "l", "e", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "B", "e", "r", "n", "i", "c", "e", " ", "c", "a", "l", "m", "l", "y", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "a", "i", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "m", "i", "n", "u", "t", "e", "s", " ", "l", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", ",", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", " ", "l", "a", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "